 Call it again after a save and it remounts the tree on the same window.
 
+The local 1git patch supports `<div windowDrag />` on empty chrome. It calls
+GPUI's native window-move operation synchronously on primary mouse down;
+double-click zooms the window. Keep drag regions separate from interactive
+controls. JavaScript callbacks run too late to reliably use AppKit's current
+mouse event. `appOwnsTitlebarDrag` leaves the window movable and preserves
+native Window-menu tiling. Neither setting changes tab order by itself.
+
 ### The macOS menu bar
 
